  "nextAction": "Continue the user-prioritized mobile companion refinement from this checkpoint without repeated authorization. Preserve touch activation, continuous walking through clear space, explicit cancellation, readable help, reduced-motion stillness, saved progress and canonical scene ownership. Full journey integration remains deferred. S03.acceptance remains first unresolved; device, full accessibility and stage/release acceptance remain open.",
  "limitations": [
    "Position reset is an explicit localized Useful actions control. It closes help and restores the default local position; it does not hide/show the companion or reset saved guide progress.",
